{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233570","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233570","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1423357001:1":{"text":"这些巨大的齿轮……","source_cn":"这些巨大的齿轮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1578CD66EB3FDF4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423357002:1":{"text":"这些就是钢心帝国水利设施的遗迹。","source_cn":"这些就是钢心帝国水利设施的遗迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9640CE464FC99500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423357003:1":{"text":"萨洛克兰的地下暗河水系丰富，落差又较多，很适合修建这样的设施作为能源的来源。","source_cn":"萨洛克兰的地下暗河水系丰富，落差又较多，很适合修建这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF5C9677152F80C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423357004:1":{"text":"萨洛克兰建国初期曾经有贤者提议能否重新利用这些水利设施，奈萨雷斯以人力不足为由否决了……","source_cn":"萨洛克兰建国初期曾经有贤者提议能否重新利用这些水利设施...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBCA75ABE8320B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423357005:1":{"text":"好壮观……","source_cn":"好壮观……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D8002980B475E61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:142